# Public exports only: default deny new file types.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!index.html
!units/
!units/*/
!units/*/notes.md
!units/*/review.md
!units/*/practice.md
!units/*/index.html
# Never add source media, source text, credentials, or personal backups.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.wav
*.srt
*.vtt
*.pdf
*.json
*.zip
.env*
**/*transcript*
**/*my-work*
**/*my-study-copy*
